    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d433-a1">

                <pb facs="0605" n="531" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg531"/>

                <head>Mr. Clay to Mr. Leiva.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States at the
                                Republic of Honduras,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Tegucigalpa,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-05-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 22, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to enclose to you a
                    printed copy of the proclamation issued by his Excellency the President of the
                    United States of America, dated the 2d of April last. Have the kindness to place
                    it before his Excellency the President of the republic, as it declares the
                    insurrection at an end in certain States of the Union which had been in
                    rebellion.</p>
                <p>With the highest consideration, I am, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. CLAY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ponciano Leiva,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Foreign Relations</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
